Key Takeaway

Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) is an important Microsoft Entra ID feature that allows users to securely reset their own passwords without IT assistance. By implementing SSPR, organizations can reduce support costs, improve user productivity, strengthen identity security, and streamline password management across enterprise environments.
